cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "FlagLabel: Annotation Tool for Camera-Trap Calibration Flags"
abstract: >-
  FlagLabel is a keyboard-driven annotation tool for distance-flag calibration
  in wildlife camera-trap surveys. Annotators mark where each numbered flag's
  wire meets the ground, spans across the flag body, flag boxes, and flag masks
  (SAM3-assisted or hand-drawn polygons), each tagged with its transect and
  distance. Each image produces one JSON file (schema v2) of image-pixel
  coordinates for downstream camera calibration and distance estimation. It
  runs as a desktop app (macOS, Windows) and as a web app.
type: software
